ONOREES】\nL15:   * 【9†PROGRAM】\nL16: \nL17:   *   * 【10†Japanease】\nL18: \nL19: # COMPETITION\nL20: ## COMPETITION\nL21: \nL22: Tokyo Anime Award Festival (TAAF) called for entries of feature and short animated films with originality, strong messages and new possibilities from all over the world. High-quality feature and short films with originality from around the world were screened and evaluated based on the four criteria: \"Originality\", \"Innovative Vision\", \"Popular Appeal\", and \"Technique\", and award winners were selected accordingly.\nL23: ## Categories\nL24: \nL25:   1. Feature Animation (60 min. or longer)\nL26:   2. Short Animation (less than 30 min. )\nL27: \nL28: ＊For medium-length films (30 minutes or more, but less than 60 minutes), the TAAF office determined whether the films should be classified as feature or short films, in accordance with the submission regulations.\nL29: \nL30: \nL31: \nL32: 【3†PAST WINNERS】\nL33: \nL34: ## Awards\nL35: \nL36: ### Feature Animation\nL37: \nL38:   * Grand Prize (a cash award of 500,000 yen)\nL39:   * Award of Excellence (a cash award of 100,000 yen)\nL40: ### Short Animation\nL41: \nL42:   * Grand Prize (a cash award of 500,000 yen)\nL43:   * Award of Excellence (a cash award of 100,000 yen)\nL44:   * Toshima City Award\nL45:   * Best Student Film (entries in Short Animation, a cash award of 100,000 yen)\nL46: \nL47: 【11†PAGETOP】\nL48: \nL49:   * 【12†Terms of Use】\nL50:   * 【13†Privacy Policy】\nL51:   * 【10†HOME】\nL52:   * 【14†ABOUT】\nL53:     * 【15†OUTLINE】\nL54:     * 【16†WHAT IS TAAF】\nL55:   * 【14†COMPETITION】\nL56:     * 【17†COMPETITION】\nL57:     * 【18†PAST WINNERS】\nL58:     * 【19†PAST JURIES】\nL59:   * 【14†ANIME OF THE YEAR】\nL60:     * 【20†ANIME OF THE YEAR】\nL61:     * 【21†PAST WINNERS】\nL62:   * 【14†ACHIEVEMENT AWARD】\nL63:     * 【22†ACHIEVEMENT AWARD】\nL64:     * 【23†PAST HONOREES】\nL65:   * 【9†PROGRAM】\nL66: \nL67: ©TAAFEC. All Rights Reserved.\n"
